        "question_text": "<p>Find the remainder when $7^{10}$ is divided by 5.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Use modular arithmetic: $7 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{5}$.<br>Thus, $7^{10} \\equiv 2^{10} \\pmod{5}$.<br>$2^4 = 16 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{5}$, so $2^{10} = (2^4)^2 \\cdot 2^2 \\equiv 1^2 \\cdot 4 \\equiv 4 \\pmod{5}$.<br>The remainder is 4.</p>",
